Image ( https://youtu.be/iUxR885NLK4?utm_source=3Dthedropnewsletter&utm_med=
ium=3Demail&utm_campaign=3Dlaunch&utm_content=3Dheader )
=C2=A0

=C2=A0

We're excited to announce that our newsletter has officially become The Dro=
p!

=C2=A0

=C2=A0

Each issue will always have three sections:

=C2=A0

* In The Know - The tech industry is moving fast, and we've found it's usef=
ul to stay up to date on latest trends, changes, etc. This content will com=
e from the things we've noticed going on in tech, productivity, and custome=
r experience. It will be actionable data for your business.=C2=A0
* Just For You - This is the stuff we think will help you enable your brand=
. Often it will be a summary of our best blog content. Our content team is =
working hard to put together guides, ideas, and walk-throughs that give you=
 practical ideas to improve the work you do.
* CloudApp Tips=C2=A0- Of course, it's our belief that using CloudApp will =
noticeably increase your productivity and ability to communicate. This last=
 section is going to highlight key features, use cases, and other ideas usi=
ng CloudApp that will help improve your productivity.=C2=A0

Image

=C2=A0Image
=C2=A0

Mary Meeker released her Internet Trends Report on June 11th. The report ov=
erviews the top trends in digital including internet access, ecommerce, usa=
ge, growth, and more. There is a=C2=A0ton of great data (333 slides worth!)=
, so here are just a couple of highlights we felt like were impactful.=C2=
=A0

* More than 50% of the world is now on the internet ( https://www.bondcap.c=
om/#view/9 ).
* We continue to rely on the internet and digital media more and more (surp=
rise). But how much? According to Meeker, US adults now average more than 6=
 hours ( https://www.bondcap.com/#view/41 ) of digital media use per day. A=
nd that usage growth has been accelerating.
* As the world's internet market gets closer to it's cap (89% of North Amer=
icans are online), customer acquisition costs continue to rise ( https://ww=
w.bondcap.com/#view/4 ).

=C2=A0

This means that retention and expansion will rise in importance when it com=
es to business growth. No wonder so many are placing emphasis on the custom=
er experience.=C2=A0 Which by the way....

Image

=C2=A0Image ( https://www.getcloudapp.com/blog/customer-experience-executiv=
e-guide?utm_source=3Dthedropnewsletter&utm_medium=3Demail&utm_campaign=3Dla=
unch&utm_content=3Dheader )
=C2=A0

Customer experience is the common thread that reveals pain points, molds br=
and positioning, determines product updates, and identifies potential effic=
iency opportunities. We've put together this guide to help executives and t=
heir teams formulate a plan that delivers exceptional customer experience.

Get The Guide
( https://www.getcloudapp.com/blog/customer-experience-executive-guide?utm_=
source=3Dthedropnewsletter&utm_medium=3Demail&utm_campaign=3Dlaunch&utm_con=
tent=3Dbutton )

Image

CloudApp Tips

=C2=A0

Did you know there are four sharing options when you create a new drop?=C2=
=A0You can find them by opening the CloudApp desktop menu; they're under "P=
references" on a Mac, "Settings" on a PC.

=C2=A0Image
=C2=A0

Copy Share Link -=C2=A0When you set the "Copy Share Link" to occur when a d=
rop is ready, a link will automatically copy to your clipboard. Use that li=
nk to share with other people immediately. This is the default setting when=
 you first install CloudApp.

Image ( https://cl.ly/91a7d8f0e8ff?utm_source=3Dthedropnewsletter&utm_mediu=
m=3Demail&utm_campaign=3Dlaunch )

Copy Direct Link -=C2=A0When you copy a direct link, this will copy the url=
 to the direct asset. Rather than the image showing up in the CloudApp inte=
rface online, users who click this link will see only the image.=C2=A0

Image ( https://cl.ly/404d18b87bdd )

Copy Download Link - When you copy a download link, this will copy the down=
load url of the direct asset. Pasting this into your browser will automatic=
ally trigger a file download onto your computer.

Image ( https://cl.ly/8ed24251a611?utm_source=3Dthedropnewsletter&utm_mediu=
m=3Demail&utm_campaign=3Dlaunch )

Copy Content -=C2=A0When you copy the content, the asset will actually be c=
opied to your clipboard, and you can paste it straight into your desired lo=
cation.

Image ( https://cl.ly/f71dc82adc91?utm_source=3Dthedropnewsletter&utm_mediu=
m=3Demail&utm_campaign=3Dlaunch )

Over 3 million people use CloudApp to work faster.

